{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57174","headline":"大乘赞十首 四 · 宝志","name":"大乘赞十首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"报你衆生直道，非有即是非无。\n非有非无不二，何须对有论虚？\n有无妄心立号，一破一个不居。\n两名由尔情作，无情即本真如。\n若欲存情覔佛，将网山上罗鱼。\n徒费功夫无益，几许枉用功夫。\n不解即心即佛，真似骑驴覔驴。\n一切不憎不爱，遮个烦恼须除。\n除之则须除身，除身无佛无因。\n无佛无因可得，自然无法无人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}